schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-map-resonance-core
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Top-down dungeon map of the Resonance Core — Zone 6 of Echo of Manifestation, a survival horror
    roguelite. Dark fantasy game design document style, bird's-eye architectural floor plan.

    The map shows an industrial engine-room complex — the Zone's power source — with harmonic
    architecture and resonance pulse mechanics throughout:

    ENTRY (west): A maintenance shaft from Zone 5's threshold corridor. Industrial catwalk leads to
    a resonance calibration shrine. Emergency lighting strips along the floor.

    HARMONIC CONDUIT HALL — COMBAT (center-west): 24m x 12m long hall lined with humming resonance
    conduits drawn as cylindrical pipes along both walls with energy pulse indicators. Energy pulses
    travel along walls shown as amber wave-front lines. Two essence nodes mounted on conduit junctions.
    Four shadow nodes: inside conduit housings, at energy pulse apexes, behind junction panels.
    CONDUIT OVERLOAD ZONES marked with electric arc hazard symbols — 8-15 second cycle. The conduits
    are the dominant visual feature, making the hall feel like an industrial corridor running through
    a living machine.

    FREQUENCY LOCK CHAMBER — PUZZLE (south): 10m x 10m cube-shaped room. Resonance tuning forks at
    each corner drawn as large fork-shaped icons. Each fork emits a tone indicator (musical note with
    frequency label). One essence node revealed at center after correct sequence. Three shadow nodes
    behind incorrect forks, spawning on feedback events. RESONANCE FEEDBACK hazard shown as expanding
    concentric rings from wrong notes with input lag indicator.

    CRYSTAL AMPLIFIER VAULT — LOOT (north): 14m x 12m. Raw resonance crystals growing from every
    surface drawn as geometric crystalline formations. Central amplifier drawn as a focusing lens
    structure. Crystalline storage containers. Four essence nodes: three crystal clusters, one
    amplifier core. Two shadow nodes embedded in overcharged crystals. CRYSTAL RESONANCE BURST hazard
    marked with 30% explosion indicators near mining points. A TIME DILATION POCKET behind the
    amplifier reachable only by mining a specific crystal cluster.

    THE SILENT FREQUENCY — SECRET (accessible via resonance-locked floor hatch): 8m x 8m perfectly
    sound-dampened chamber drawn with dashed border. Drawn differently from all other rooms — no
    resonance energy indicators, no pulse lines, completely blank interior suggesting total silence.
    One essence node at center (pure silence essence). NO SHADOW NODES — marked explicitly as a
    shadow-free zone. SENSORY DEPRIVATION hazard shown with crossed-out minimap and crossed-out
    speaker icons. Scrying function shown as an eye icon revealing the next 3 rooms' layouts.

    RESONANCE ENGINE CORE — BOSS (east): 22m x 22m central engine room. A massive pulsating sphere
    of contained energy at center drawn as a layered concentric circle with energy corona. Conductive
    walkways extend like spokes around it (4-6 spokes varying per run). The engine's energy distorts
    the arena shown as wavering line effects. Four essence nodes at the end of each cardinal spoke
    walkway. Six shadow nodes: orbiting the engine sphere, inside walkway supports, manifested in
    energy distortions. RESONANCE PULSE hazard shown as expanding energy rings every 15 seconds with
    knockback indicators. Walkway retraction zones marked. A TIME DILATION POCKET beneath the engine
    sphere accessible only during boss phase 2 when the sphere lifts. Boss marker: "THRESHOLD
    GUARDIAN" with a wall-guardian icon. THE CORE'S HEARTBEAT shown as a periodic damage pulse
    indicator affecting the entire arena at regular intervals.

    The resonance pulse mechanic permeates the entire zone — pulse wave lines shown in corridors
    between rooms. Transmutation cooldown doubling effect marked near all resonance-dense areas.

    Map legend: Amber diamond = Essence Node, Purple circle = Shadow Node, Golden bubble = Time
    Dilation Pocket, Dashed border = Secret Room, Skull icon = Boss, Electric arc = Conduit Overload,
    Expanding ring = Resonance Pulse, Clock icon = Cooldown Double Zone.

    Style: Architectural blueprint on dark industrial background with molten copper accents. Room
    walls in shadow-black lines with white-hot seam highlights. Pistons and gears drawn as mechanical
    elements in corridor connections. Steam obscuration effects shown as translucent gray overlays.
    The entire map should feel like looking at the blueprints of a machine that is also alive.
    Professional game design document aesthetic with industrial horror mood.
  negative: "bright colors, cartoon, anime, 3D rendered, photorealistic, clean industrial, bright copper, cheerful, colorful, organic, nature, low detail"

output:
  formats:
